<title>SPAIN: Abengoa expects 10/12 pct growth in next 4 yrs.</title>
<headline>Abengoa expects 10/12 pct growth in next 4 yrs.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's applied engineering group Abengoa said on Wednesday it expected the group to grow between 10 and 12 percent annually in each of the next four years.</p>
<p>&quot;Growth in the next four years will be between 10 and 12 percent,&quot; Juan Perez Rodriguez, financial director of Abengoa told analysts in a presentation.</p>
<p>The company expects return on equity, which was 10.10 percent in 1996, would be 11.6 percent this year.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
